## Critical Notes
<critical>
- ALWAYS mark receipt as mut when using std::mem::take()
- ALWAYS include catch-all pattern for InnerReceipt enum
- NEVER assume InnerReceipt is exhaustive
- NEVER write duplicate data to journal
- ALWAYS validate journal structure before processing
- Use unique markers for different journal sections
- Handle ownership transfer carefully
- Use proper error handling for unknown variants
- Emit appropriate metrics for failures
</critical> 